Hello everyone, the update for version 1.3 is still mainly for bug fixes based on the 1.2 beta version, the updates are as follows:

1. Encyclopedia adaptation problem adjustment, now can also ESC off;
2. Options interface to increase the manual save function, before entering the copy, you can manually save to add extra insurance;
3. automatic archive will be moved to memory, manual archive placed locally, in an attempt to completely solve the problem of character card loss or scene conversion when other cards are lost;
4. The problem that the cultivator's spiritual root has no actual numerical change has been fixed, and the new version needs to reload and unload the equipment's spells to see the numerical change.

Finally, I wish you all a happy game, if you have any game problems, welcome to give us feedback, or join the game group 715191519 to tell us, thank you!

